        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> make a new release if they pass.\r\n\r\nNote, the last release [should](https://www.gnu.org/software/libtool/manual/html_node/Manual-version-info-update.html) have bumped [LT_REVISION](https://github.com/neovim/unibilium/blob/7e43ffbcb5539109e3835a785a01da3e08fdaa61/Makefile.in#L23) to 2. Now that the shared-library version information is correctly being set in [CMakeLists.txt](https://github.com/neovim/unibilium/blob/7e43ffbcb5539109e3835a785a01da3e08fdaa61/CMakeLists.txt#L13), that should also be updated.\r\n\r\nThere should also be an annotated tag for the release. v2.1.3 was just a lightweight tag.",
