        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I don't think annotated or not makes a difference to releases? (At least, all other projects I maintain work fine with lightweight tags.)\n\nEDIT: I may not have pushed any tag at all (yet) because I wanted to run downstream CI first. \r\n\r\nIn any case, it sounds like it's better if you handle the release, so please go ahead!",
